Z||000000||Carolina 88GT||03-22-2000||08:02 AM||||Feeling good this morning and had to share with the rest of my bretheren  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.  Pulled up to a stoplight this morning and was watching an early 90's iroc switch lanes and pull up next to me.  This was going to be one of those definate races as the right hand lane ends and merges left a little short of a 1/4 mile.  Anyways....he pulls around to my right (absolutely NO traffic, we are alone) and he is already rolling forward when the light turns green.  I punch it and I hear him do the same and to start with he had  me by a nose, but I dropped the sucker into second and leaped ahead by a full car length and it only got better from there. We both shut down and gave a wave (nothing better than a friendly race) and he turned off.  Made my whole day  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
