Z||000006||GT Bastard||03-24-2000||12:41 AM||||91-92 were just plain Z's....  I believe the kill.  I've owned a 5.0 auto IROC, and it wasn't pretty.  Lots of them were non-posi wish 2.73 gears.... They'll still smoke the tires a bit, but they seriously lack in acceleration.  87-90 IROCs had a 5.7L V8 as an option, but there were fewer of them.  I'm guessing you bagged a 5.0 IROC.  ||||reg||1
